<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-19T04:59:02.653Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 04:59:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent incidents continue in the southern provinces, with two policemen killed in separate attacks and a pipe bomb wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala. Grenade attacks in Trang led to arrests and the seizure of bombs, while a cross-border rice-smuggling syndicate in the Malaysia-Thailand frontier used cranes to load trailers. An Israeli tourist was killed in a motorcycle crash in Krabi province, and Chinese travelers have been warned of kidnapping and job-scam risks by their embassy. The conflict recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOUUh5clVHanViYnJJVW0xajBfTjNsNEdKQ1J1dTQxOUVQc2prenBmMDQza3lCc0lKRW9hVkJBMmhQYlVoN2ozeTFPR05QLUFKaWdzMFZDVVBxaS1ld0tLeVJsMlh1RlY1a1BTb0Z1UkV0bi1scEYxV053U1VkNFNxMm1SSFQxbVpNcVRHRWx2RDFjelVsOEhIb2ZMb1lvNHBTMlR1RHRGRzlIdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNazJCTkxIeXhPazQ0a2dQcTRlY2E4bkNERTVRT3oxamJEMTFMa0hkLVdBOWEtellZZkx5aXRuNzdWNWdUZTNndzBaSk1HalBaWkdfclItMnd0aUNGV0JGbE5HUlZSbjhVYlU0a2NKMUVMU195OWh6NV9taGNDUDgzMmg4cjlHNHAtSFR1bFhuVUp1QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNR1F1akRpaEVEU3hPejA2TGhxTDB0YTdaOUp1VENFdDNGVkdKT29URWFUVjhBSXhpeEVZVnVfSk1fSk55OTVPZGpRSHdrellQOFdmM2d0WGhsSDIzRHBGSjNWQnVJVGg0Sk1yV2JNZElnYW80b2NOOUR4Wl9zLVpZOUNBY1lWV3BTRnZITjhDMGFEOEVZOVh1SDlYU3hsUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxORkhoZmNmRnh0TC1SYnpUSmx6RElibUJlNmVobDVzRGl3clpBUFcwQjdUbUhBeFpSTk8zWEcyZ3l4Z2EybE5FQ1hnNm1xbGs2ZjB0RkVTMHVHZV9LdElPeTRi